#. ………………
msgctxt "0001 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. えっと…ロッカーの中にパソコンがあるでしょ？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Okay, so...there's a laptop inside the locker,\n"
"understand?"
msgstr ""

#. そこのパソコンに入ってるプログラムが
#. アルターエゴって言うんだけど…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And on the laptop there's a program called Alter Ego."
msgstr ""

#. どうやって…話せばいい…？
msgctxt "0004 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "How do I...talk to him?"
msgstr ""

#. え、えっと…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Oh, um..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、ボクが入力するから…
#. なんて話したいのか言ってくれる？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, you just tell me what you want to say, and I'll\n"
"type it in for you."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0007 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 兄弟を…恨んでいるか…？
msgctxt "0008 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Do you...hate Mondo?"
msgstr ""

#. 兄弟を止められなかった僕を…
#. 恨んでいるか…？
msgctxt "0009 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "And since I couldn't stop him...do you hate me?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは…絞り出すような声だった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was clear he was forcing himself to get the words\n"
"out.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>喉から…心の奥から…
#. 必死で絞り出したような弱々しい声…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From his mouth, from the bottom of his heart...he\n"
"forced his weakened voice to make the sounds.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …頼む。
msgctxt "0012 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "...Please."
msgstr ""

#. わ、わかったよ…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは石丸クンに言われたままの文章を、
#. キーボードに打ち込んでいった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I typed the questions exactly as Taka had asked them.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0016 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 責任を…感じてるの？
msgctxt "0017 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "Do you hold yourself responsible...?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、きっとご主人タマなら、
#. こう言うと思うんだぁ…
msgctxt "0018 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"If Master could talk now, I think this is what he\n"
"would say..."
msgstr ""

#. 僕の分まで生きてください…
msgctxt "0019 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "Please, live your life for the both of us."
msgstr ""

#. 僕は無理だったけど…
#. みんなは必ずここから生きて帰ってね…って…
msgctxt "0020 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"It's impossible for me now, but you can still survive\n"
"and escape—all of you."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0021 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ねぇ、石丸クン…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, Taka..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、開きかけたボクの口は、
#. すぐに閉じる事になった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I was about to say more, but quickly closed my\n"
"mouth...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 今の質問したのって…石丸君でしょ？
msgctxt "0024 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "The one asking those questions is...Taka, right?"
msgstr ""

#. データから分析する限り、
#. そうとしか考えられないよぉ。
msgctxt "0025 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"Analyzing all available data, that's the only\n"
"conclusion I can come to."
msgstr ""

#. 石丸君って、大和田君と仲良しだって
#. ご主人タマから聞いてるよぉ。
msgctxt "0026 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "Master told me how close Taka and Mondo had become."
msgstr ""

#. だから…責任を感じてるんでしょ…？
msgctxt "0027 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "So that must be why he feels responsible..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると、そこで画面は暗転し…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The screen suddenly went dark.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>次に、画面上に映し出されたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And what appeared next was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. で、その責任の重さに、
#. 潰れちまったんじゃねーだろうなぁ！？
msgctxt "0030 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"You're not letting yourself get crushed under the\n"
"weight of that responsibility, are you!?"
msgstr ""

#. うっ…！！
msgctxt "0031 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Gh—!"
msgstr ""

#. …男の重さってのはよぉ、
#. その男が背負ってるモンの重さなんだぜ…
msgctxt "0032 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "A man's only worth as much as the load he can carry!"
msgstr ""

#. わかるだろ…兄弟…？
msgctxt "0033 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "You get it, right bro?"
msgstr ""

#. オメーなら、わかるはずだぞ…
msgctxt "0034 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "Hell, what am I saying? Of course ya do!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0035 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. こ、これって…！！
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-That's...!"
msgstr ""

#. ビックリさせてたらゴメンね。
msgctxt "0037 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "I'm sorry if I startled you..."
msgstr ""

#. ご主人タマが入力してた大和田君の情報を元に、
#. 僕なりにシミュレーションしてみたんだぁ。
msgctxt "0038 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"That was my attempt at a simulation, using the data\n"
"about Mondo that Master had given me."
msgstr ""

#. 大和田君が、落ち込んでる石丸君に声を掛けるなら、
#. こんな言葉なんじゃないかって…
msgctxt "0039 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"I figured if Taka was depressed, that's the kind of\n"
"thing Mondo would have said to him..."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、立ち止るのはしかたねー…
#. せいぜい時間をかけやがれってんだ…
msgctxt "0040 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"So you're just gonna stand there, huh? Just wait for\n"
"things to get better?"
msgstr ""

#. 時間かけて落ち込んで…
msgctxt "0041 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "Just take your time and get all depressed..."
msgstr ""

#. 時間かけて後悔して…
msgctxt "0042 | ALTER EGO"
msgid "Take the time to indulge your regrets..."
msgstr ""

#. そんで、気付いたらいつの間にか歩き出してる…
msgctxt "0043 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"You might even start walking again without realizing\n"
"it."
msgstr ""

#. 人間ってのはよ…
#. それくらいテキトーに出来てんだ…
msgctxt "0044 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"Sure, that kind of mediocre thinking might work\n"
"for some people."
msgstr ""

#. …なんて、エラそうに言っちゃったりして！
msgctxt "0045 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"...What if I said it with that kind of condescending\n"
"tone!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0046 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ハハ……ハハハ……
msgctxt "0047 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Hehe... Hahaha..."
msgstr ""

#. 石丸クン…？
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Taka...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0049 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 染み…込んだ……ぜ…
msgctxt "0050 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "It's starting to sink in..."
msgstr ""

#. カラカラに乾いたスポンジが…
#. 水を…吸い込むように…
msgctxt "0051 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"The way a bucketful of water sinks into a bone-dry\n"
"sponge..."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 今の言葉が…今の魂がぁぁぁッ！
msgctxt "0053 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Those words... Deep within my heart...!"
msgstr ""

#. 僕の中にぃぃぃ！！
msgctxt "0054 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "They're inside of me!"
msgstr ""

#. うおおおぉぉぉぉぉおおおおぉぉぉおおッ！！
msgctxt "0055 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Uwaaaaaaaaaaaaahhh!"
msgstr ""

#. 石丸…クン！？
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "T-Taka!?"
msgstr ""

#. 石丸ってのはどいつだーッ！？
msgctxt "0057 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Who the fudge is Taka!?"
msgstr ""

#. え…目つきが…
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Your eyes..."
msgstr ""

#. オウッ、もう心配はいらねーぞ！
#. 悪かったな、迷惑掛けちまってよぉ！
msgctxt "0059 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Hey, don't worry about it! Guess I caused kind of a\n"
"scene, huh? Shoot, man..."
msgstr ""

#. 口調も…
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And your voice..."
msgstr ""

#. オレは…新しいオレになったんだ…
msgctxt "0061 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I'm...a new me..."
msgstr ""

#. オラァ！　気合いブリバリだってんだッ！！
#. バカヤロウッ！！
msgctxt "0062 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Hraaah! I'm totally stuffed with fighting spirit now!\n"
"Ya dumbbutt!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょ…石丸クン…落ち着いて…！
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay, Taka... Just calm down."
msgstr ""

#. 落ち着いてんだろうがぁ！！
#. つーか、石丸なんて呼ぶんじゃねーよ！
msgctxt "0064 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I AM calm! And don't call me Taka!"
msgstr ""

#. オレは…もう石丸じゃねぇ…
msgctxt "0065 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "That's...that's not my name anymore..."
msgstr ""

#. オレだッ！！
msgctxt "0066 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I'm...me!"
msgstr ""

#. オレなんだぁぁぁぁああああッ！！
msgctxt "0067 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I! Am! Meeeeeee!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>妙な叫び声を上げながら、
#. 石丸クンは脱衣所を飛び出していった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Taka let out a bone-chilling howl and ran out of the\n"
"room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと待ってよ！
#. 石丸クンッ！！
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hey! Taka, hold on!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>後を追おうと、すぐに走り出したのだが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And I took off after him...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこに立ちはだかった人物が１人。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But someone stood in my way.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>石丸クンと入れ替わるようにして、
#. 脱衣所へとやって来た彼女だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As if tagging Taka out, she walked briskly into the\n"
"dressing room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何を…してるの？
msgctxt "0073 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What do you think you're doing?"
msgstr ""

#. き、霧切さん…！
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "K-Kyoko!"
msgstr ""

#. いや、これは…その……
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, um...no, see...this is just—"
msgstr ""

#. …勝手な事しないで。
#. 迷惑なの。私だけじゃなく他のみんなにも…
msgctxt "0076 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Don't go around doing whatever you feel like. It\n"
"causes problems. And not just for me. For everyone."
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめん……
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. 謝る気持ちがあるなら、
#. すぐに、ここから出てって…
msgctxt "0078 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If you're really sorry, you'll get out of here. Now."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. わ、わかり…ました……
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>結局、ボクはすごすごと
#. 自分の部屋に戻る羽目になった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Finally, I headed back to my room, embarrassed and\n"
"sullen.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
